    "caveats": [
      "Verify the exact sinusoidal shear target against your literature source — sinusoids are often cited at 0.01–0.05 Pa; if you want the very lowest value, use 0.4 µL/min instead of 2 µL/min.",
      "Primary human hepatocytes are BSL-2 material and do not divide in vitro; confirm seeding density (1e5 cells/cm²) and viability before loading.",
      "Culture medium viscosity is assumed water-like (1e-3 Pa·s); serum-containing medium can be slightly higher, which would raise shear at the same flow — confirm with your medium.",
